      "text": "The review followed PRISMA 2020 with a meta-analytic extension. Four design choices shaped the protocol: a deliberately narrow climate filter (KÃ¶ppen A, Cwa, Cfa-warm, BSh), dual independent screening with a third adjudicator, a harmonised effect-size extraction sheet that converted heterogeneous metrics into a common ÎT and percentage-saving frame, and pre-registered subgroup analyses on wall type, orientation, and humidity regime. Subsections III.A through III.D detail the protocol, search and screening, data extraction with meta-analytic statistics, and quality assessment."
